00:22:42,535 --> 00:22:44,754
THAT'S A FUNNY COINCIDENCE.

424
00:22:44,754 --> 00:22:48,323
I TOLD YOU
I'D BE SEEING YOU.

425
00:22:48,323 --> 00:22:50,369
YEAH.MM.

426
00:22:50,369 --> 00:22:52,980
WELL, YOU LOOK WELL,
I GOTTA SAY.

427
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:58,202
YOU'RE IN
A VERY RELAXED STATE.

428
00:22:58,202 --> 00:23:00,422
NOW CONFESS THAT
YOU KILLED KELLY FLOWER,

429
00:23:00,422 --> 00:23:04,121
AND A HUGE BURDEN
WILL BE LIFTED.

430
00:23:04,121 --> 00:23:07,386
FUNNY GUY.

431
00:23:07,386 --> 00:23:09,779
SENSE OF HUMOR. THAT'S GREAT.

432
00:23:09,779 --> 00:23:13,522
YEAH. WELL,
MAYBE I DID SOMETHING WRONG.MM.

433
00:23:13,522 --> 00:23:17,483
SORRY TO, UH, BOTHER YOU.ACCIDENTS HAPPEN.

434
00:23:17,483 --> 00:23:19,572
YEAH.

435
00:23:22,357 --> 00:23:25,360
[clears throat]

436
00:23:25,360 --> 00:23:28,842
HYPNOSIS. GREAT PLAN.

437
00:23:28,842 --> 00:23:30,844
[lowers voice]
NO, THAT WOULD BE SILLY.

438
00:23:30,844 --> 00:23:32,889
HYPNOSIS IS ILLEGAL.

439
00:23:32,889 --> 00:23:35,849
THAT WAS A MISDIRECT SO THAT I
COULD SEARCH HIS JACKET POCKETS

440
00:23:35,849 --> 00:23:37,981
AND FIND... [whispers] THIS.

441
00:23:43,857 --> 00:23:47,426
A BUTTON,
FLUFF AND SOME SAND?

442
00:23:47,426 --> 00:23:51,081
YEAH.
IT'S A LITTLE ANTICLIMACTIC.

443
00:23:51,081 --> 00:23:55,129
UM, DO YOU HAVE
AN EVIDENCE BAGGIE?

444
00:23:55,129 --> 00:23:57,479
[clears throat]

445
00:23:57,479 --> 00:23:59,307
YOU'RE WALKING HOME.

446
00:23:59,307 --> 00:24:02,310
OR I COULD JUST CARRY IT.

447
00:24:02,310 --> 00:24:04,312
SO SYLVAN'S FINANCIALS
ARE CLEAN.

448
00:24:04,312 --> 00:24:06,270
THERE'S JUST ONE THING
I DON'T GET.

449
00:24:06,270 --> 00:24:08,316
THE END OF EVERY MONTH,

450
00:24:08,316 --> 00:24:10,318
HE WITHDRAWS
JUST OVER 2 GRAND IN CASH.

451
00:24:10,318 --> 00:24:13,190
HE HAS NO FAMILY,
NO GIRLFRIEND.SOUNDS LIKE RENT.

452
00:24:13,190 --> 00:24:17,281
HIS APARTMENT'S ONLY $900,
AND HE WRITES A CHECK FOR THAT.NO, NOT HIS APARTMENT--
HIS HOME.

453
00:24:17,281 --> 00:24:20,197
A PLACE TO STORE HIS TOOLS,
PROCESS HIS VICTIMS,

454
00:24:20,197 --> 00:24:23,940
KEEP HIS TROPHIES.A MURDER HOUSE. AND IF HE'S
PAYING CASH, IT'S A FAIR BET

455
00:24:23,940 --> 00:24:26,116
THE NAME CALE SYLVAN
WON'T BE ON THE LEASE.

456
00:24:26,116 --> 00:24:29,337
THE PLACE COULD BE ANYWHERE.MAYBE I CAN NARROW IT
A LITTLE. LOOK AT THIS.

457
00:24:31,252 --> 00:24:34,560
THIS IS FROM
THE SYLVAN MURDER VIDEO.[presses keys]

458
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:36,562
THE BAG HE'S HOLDING--
IT'S FROM ABS GYM.

459
00:24:36,562 --> 00:24:39,216
WE SHOW HIS PICTURE
AROUND THE GYM.

460
00:24:39,216 --> 00:24:42,176
MAYBE WE FIND SOMEONE
WHO KNOWS HIS OTHER ADDRESS.THERE'S A DOZEN ABS GYMS
AROUND HERE.

461
00:24:42,176 --> 00:24:46,485
IT'LL TAKE DAYS
TO CANVASS 'EM.I'LL START WITH THE ONES BY
THE RIVER. THE SAND JANE FOUND

462
00:24:46,485 --> 00:24:50,924
IN SYLVAN'S POCKETS--
IT'S RIVER SAND, NOT OCEAN SAND.HOW'D YOU KNOW?

463
00:24:50,924 --> 00:24:54,493
WE'RE IN SACRAMENTO.
WE GOT A RIVER, NOT AN OCEAN.THERE'S ONLY ONE ABS GYM
NEAR THE RIVER--ON DOS ROBLES.

464
00:24:54,493 --> 00:24:57,452
[Rigsby] ON MY WAY.IF YOU GET AN ADDRESS,
GO STRAIGHT TO JUDGE HILDRED

465
00:24:57,452 --> 00:25:00,455
AND GET A SEARCH WARRANT.
WE'LL TAKE DOWN SYLVAN TODAY.

466
00:25:05,982 --> 00:25:09,943
[man whimpering]

467
00:25:11,988 --> 00:25:13,424
AW, SHUT UP.

468
00:25:13,424 --> 00:25:15,339
♪♪

469
00:25:15,339 --> 00:25:18,299
YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE EMBEZZLED
ALL THAT MONEY, YOU BIG BABY.

470
00:25:18,299 --> 00:25:19,605
[crunches]

471
00:25:22,825 --> 00:25:25,175
[gunfire]

472
00:25:25,175 --> 00:25:27,787
TIME TO GO TO WORK.

473
00:25:36,273 --> 00:25:38,014
[whimpering]

474
00:25:38,014 --> 00:25:41,017
I DON'T THINK YOU'RE GONNA WANT
TO LOOK AT THIS.

475
00:25:41,017 --> 00:25:43,367
[glass shatters]

476
00:25:43,367 --> 00:25:44,978
[grunts]

477
00:25:44,978 --> 00:25:47,023
[Rigsby] FREEZE! FREEZE!
[speaks indistinctly]

478
00:25:47,023 --> 00:25:49,722
[Cho] LET ME SEE YOUR HANDS!
LET ME SEE YOUR HANDS!AAH!

479
00:25:49,722 --> 00:25:52,289
[grunts][grunts]

480
00:25:52,289 --> 00:25:53,943
[whimpers and grunts]

481
00:25:53,943 --> 00:25:56,555
[grunting]

482
00:25:56,555 --> 00:25:59,732
GET YOUR HANDS OFF OF ME!
GET YOUR HANDS OFF ME!

483
00:25:59,732 --> 00:26:03,300
HOOK HIM UP.IT'S NOT ME.
I HOPE YOU BROUGHT MORE PEOPLE.

484
00:26:03,300 --> 00:26:05,389
[Cale] CHEATING SON OF A BITCH.

485
00:26:05,389 --> 00:26:07,653
[grunts]

486
00:26:07,653 --> 00:26:09,655
YOU'RE OKAY. YOU'RE OKAY.

487
00:26:09,655 --> 00:26:11,657
THANK YOU.YOU'RE SAFE NOW.

488
00:26:11,657 --> 00:26:13,310
[spits]YOU GOT IT?

489
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:15,486
YEAH.THERE WE GO.

490
00:26:15,486 --> 00:26:17,227
[snaps cell phone shut]

491
00:26:17,227 --> 00:26:19,447
I SENT THE VICTIM
TO THE HOSPITAL.

492
00:26:19,447 --> 00:26:22,406
HE'LL BE OKAY... AFTER THREE
OR FOUR YEARS OF THERAPY.GOOD.

493
00:26:22,406 --> 00:26:26,106
YEAH, THAT LOOK'S NOT SO SCARY
WHEN YOU'RE IN HANDCUFFS, BUDDY.

494
00:26:26,106 --> 00:26:29,283
EITHER YOU TELL US
WHO HIRED YOU

495
00:26:29,283 --> 00:26:31,677
OR YOU'RE LOOKING
AT A SLAM-DUNK DEATH PENALTY.

496
00:26:31,677 --> 00:26:34,331
MAYBE WE CAN COME
TO SOME KIND OF ARRANGEMENT.

497
00:26:34,331 --> 00:26:36,595
CHO, GET DOWN!

498
00:26:36,595 --> 00:26:40,424
[gunshot][Rigsby] 10-33. SHOTS FIRED.

499
00:26:40,424 --> 00:26:43,514
MAN DOWN. WE NEED PARAMEDICS
NOW. G.S.W. TO THE CHEST.

500
00:26:43,514 --> 00:26:46,430
SHOT CAME FROM THE NORTH
OF LOCATION. NORTH OF LOCATION.

501
00:26:46,430 --> 00:26:50,043
LET'S GET A BIRD
IN HERE NOW.THE SON OF A BITCH IS DEAD.

502
00:26:59,182 --> 00:27:02,882
CALL IN ANOTHER TEAM
FOR THE BACK OF THE HOUSE.

503
00:27:02,882 --> 00:27:05,058
THANKS.

504
00:27:05,058 --> 00:27:08,061
THAT'S EIGHT BODIES SO FAR,
AND THAT'S JUST THE ONES

505
00:27:08,061 --> 00:27:11,630
SYLVAN'S CLIENTS
DIDN'T WANT FOUND.THEY'RE GONNA BE CLEARING

506
00:27:11,630 --> 00:27:14,676
MISSING PERSONS CASES
FOR A MONTH.ANY LUCK ON THE SHOOTER?

507
00:27:14,676 --> 00:27:17,244
NOT MUCH. KILL SHOT CAME
FROM THAT HILLSIDE,

508
00:27:17,244 --> 00:27:20,203
OVER TWO FOOTBALL FIELDS AWAY.THAT'S A TOUGH SHOT. SO I
GUESS WHOEVER EMPLOYED SYLVAN

509
00:27:20,203 --> 00:27:23,206
HIRED A SECOND SHOOTER
TO COVER HIS TRACKS.THE THING IS,
HOW DID THAT CLIENT KNOW

510
00:27:23,206 --> 00:27:27,297
THAT SYLVAN HAD BECOME
A LIABILITY?THAT'S A GOOD QUESTION.

511
00:27:27,297 --> 00:27:29,082
WHERE'S JANE?

512
00:27:31,171 --> 00:27:32,694
HEY.

513
00:27:32,694 --> 00:27:35,654
THIS BETTER BE GOOD.
I WAS CATCHING UP ON MY TiVo.

514
00:27:35,654 --> 00:27:37,438
LIAR. YOU WERE READING.

515
00:27:37,438 --> 00:27:40,267
BUT WHAT?
PROGRESS REPORTS?

516
00:27:40,267 --> 00:27:42,051
NO.

517
00:27:42,051 --> 00:27:45,141
WHATEVER. THIS IS
GONNA BE A LOT OF FUN.

518
00:27:45,141 --> 00:27:48,884
I'M GOING INTO
THE DRABERS' LAIR.

519
00:27:48,884 --> 00:27:52,322
IT'S NOT A LAIR, IT'S AN OFFICE,
AND NO, YOU'RE NOT.OH, YES, I AM.

520
00:27:52,322 --> 00:27:54,194
THEY SEEM KIND OF SCARY.

521
00:27:54,194 --> 00:27:56,675
YOU WOULDN'T WANT ME
TO GET HURT, WOULD YOU?

522
00:27:56,675 --> 00:28:00,156
DON'T BET ON IT.
W-WHY THE DRABERS?A HUNCH.
THEY'RE KEY IN THIS SOMEHOW.

523
00:28:00,156 --> 00:28:02,724
YOU THINK THEY HIRED SYLVAN?WELL,
SYLVAN LOOKED THE PART.

524
00:28:02,724 --> 00:28:04,683
WHY THE HELL
DIDN'T YOU CALL CHO?

525
00:28:04,683 --> 00:28:06,467
WELL, YOU WERE CLOSER.

526
00:28:06,467 --> 00:28:08,904
CALL CHO.
I'M NOT EVEN ARMED.

527
00:28:08,904 --> 00:28:11,385
MORE LIES. YOU HAVE AT LEAST
TWO GUNS IN THAT CAR.

528
00:28:13,474 --> 00:28:14,910
THREE? OH, MY.

529
00:28:14,910 --> 00:28:16,651
[groans]

530
00:28:16,651 --> 00:28:19,785
YOU'RE THE POSTER GIRL
FOR THE N.R.A.

531
00:28:19,785 --> 00:28:21,395
I'M TELLING YOU,

532
00:28:21,395 --> 00:28:23,397
I'VE GOT NOTHING TO DO
WITH THE PROSECUTOR DYING.

533
00:28:23,397 --> 00:28:26,835
AND THE SYLVAN GUY--
NEVER HEARD OF HIM

534
00:28:26,835 --> 00:28:31,100
BEFORE I SAW HIM
ON THE NEWS.HELLO.

535
00:28:31,100 --> 00:28:34,103
HI.GONNA WIN BIG.

536
00:28:34,103 --> 00:28:36,671
GONNA BUY A WASHING MACHINE.

537
00:28:36,671 --> 00:28:38,151
SHE'S A TREASURE.

538
00:28:38,151 --> 00:28:41,023
HEY. YOU WANT
TO LEAVE HER ALONE?

539
00:28:41,023 --> 00:28:44,810
SHE'S A LITTLE SOFT
IN THE HEAD, OKAY?YOU KNOW, HANK, AS YOU WERE
TALKING TO LISBON HERE,

540
00:28:44,810 --> 00:28:47,813
I COULDN'T HELP BUT NOTICE
YOU KEPT LOOKING AT YOUR MOTHER,

541
00:28:47,813 --> 00:28:50,337
AS IF YOU WERE CHECKING
FOR HER APPROVAL.

542
00:28:50,337 --> 00:28:54,167
I MEAN, MOST TOUGH GUYS ARE
SCARED OF THEIR MOTHERS,

543
00:28:54,167 --> 00:28:57,170
BUT, HANK, YOU WERE QUAKING.[laughs] YOUR FRIEND'S
CRAZIER THAN MY MOM.

544
00:28:57,170 --> 00:28:59,389
DIGGING THOSE NAILS.
PLUCKED EYEBROWS, COIFFED HAIR.

545
00:28:59,389 --> 00:29:01,827
DID YOU DO THE, UH,
MAKEOVER, HANK?

546
00:29:01,827 --> 00:29:04,003
NO, DIDN'T THINK SO.

547
00:29:04,003 --> 00:29:06,396
TIME FOR MY STORIES, HANKY.

548
00:29:06,396 --> 00:29:07,963
OKAY, HANKY.

549
00:29:07,963 --> 00:29:10,966
YOU ARE UPSETTING HER, OKAY?
SO LEAVE HER ALONE.

550
00:29:10,966 --> 00:29:12,446
EASY.

551
00:29:14,927 --> 00:29:17,930
THIS IS BRILLIANT.

552
00:29:17,930 --> 00:29:19,758
LISBON, THIS IS BRILLIANT.

553
00:29:19,758 --> 00:29:23,936
YOU--YOU ARE A TREASURE.

554
00:29:23,936 --> 00:29:25,938
YOU'RE RUNNING THIS WHOLE
OPERATION, AREN'T YOU?

555
00:29:25,938 --> 00:29:28,897
HANK'S JUST A FIGUREHEAD
TO TAKE THE HEAT. HUH?

556
00:29:28,897 --> 00:29:32,771
TELL ME I'M RIGHT. YOU KNOW,
I SHOULD HAVECHECKED THE SHOES.

557
00:29:35,861 --> 00:29:38,124
DAMN IT, HANK.

558
00:29:38,124 --> 00:29:40,779
I TOLD YOU ABOUT LOOKING AT ME,
DIDN'T I?

559
00:29:42,345 --> 00:29:46,001
YOU THINK
YOU'RE SO DAMN CLEVER.

560
00:29:46,001 --> 00:29:48,177
WELL, CLEVER IS
AS CLEVER DOES,

561
00:29:48,177 --> 00:29:51,833
AND YOU'VE JUST MADE
A VERY STUPID MOVE.

562
00:29:51,833 --> 00:29:53,661
BOYS!

563
00:29:53,661 --> 00:29:55,794
OH, DEAR.

564
00:29:57,230 --> 00:30:00,711
HOW CLEVER ARE YOU NOW EXACTLY?

565
00:30:00,711 --> 00:30:03,236
[guns cock]WE'RE COPS. JUST BE COOL.

566
00:30:03,236 --> 00:30:06,935
PUT THE WEAPONS DOWN NOW.

567
00:30:06,935 --> 00:30:10,199
YOU PUT YOUR GUN DOWN,
MISS LISBON, AND YOU CAN LIVE.

568
00:30:13,942 --> 00:30:16,249
COME ON. GET IN.

569
00:30:18,860 --> 00:30:20,906
[Hank] OKAY, LOAD 'EM OFF.

570
00:30:20,906 --> 00:30:23,299
I WAS RIGHT
ABOUT ANNABELLE ANYWAY.CONGRATULATIONS.

571
00:30:23,299 --> 00:30:25,649
[whirring]

572
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:35,877
[horn honks]

573
00:30:35,877 --> 00:30:38,010
OH, HEY.HEY.

574
00:30:38,010 --> 00:30:39,402
SO WE'RE GOOD, RIGHT?

575
00:30:39,402 --> 00:30:42,449
YOU'RE NOT GONNA PUT A HIT
OUT ON ME?

576
00:30:42,449 --> 00:30:45,539
[chuckles] YOU'VE MOVED ON.
THAT'S GOOD.

577
00:30:45,539 --> 00:30:47,019
I'VE MOVED ON, TOO.

578
00:30:47,019 --> 00:30:49,021
WELL, I'M GLAD.
THAT'S A RELIEF.

579
00:30:49,021 --> 00:30:51,110
YOU GUYS HEARD FROM JANE?

580
00:30:51,110 --> 00:30:52,763
NO.NO.

581
00:30:52,763 --> 00:30:54,896
HELLO?!

582
00:30:54,896 --> 00:30:56,898
ANYBODY?!

583
00:30:56,898 --> 00:30:58,726
HELLO?!

584
00:31:02,338 --> 00:31:05,689
I CAN'T REALLY SEE ANYTHING.

585
00:31:05,689 --> 00:31:08,910
THERE'S KIND OF A DRAFT RIGHT
HERE, THOUGH, IF YOU JUST...

586
00:31:08,910 --> 00:31:10,303
JUST THERE.

587
00:31:10,303 --> 00:31:12,871
NO FOOD, NO WATER.
THIS IS NOT GOOD.

588
00:31:15,917 --> 00:31:18,093
WELL, I SUPPOSE
WE SHOULD DRAW STRAWS

589
00:31:18,093 --> 00:31:20,139
TO SEE WHO EATS WHO FIRST.

590
00:31:20,139 --> 00:31:24,099
YEAH, RIGHT. DRAW STRAWS
WITH A PROFESSIONAL CHEAT.

591
00:31:24,099 --> 00:31:27,059
WHY SO GRUMPY? IT'S NOT LIKE
WE'RE GONNA DIE HERE.

592
00:31:27,059 --> 00:31:29,061
THE DRABERS
DON'T WANT US DEAD.

593
00:31:29,061 --> 00:31:30,758
HUH?

594
00:31:30,758 --> 00:31:33,761
COME HERE AND GET
A LITTLE BIT OF THIS BREEZE.

595
00:31:33,761 --> 00:31:35,894
IT'LL CHEER YOU UP.
COME HERE.[sighs]

596
00:31:35,894 --> 00:31:37,808
IT'S NOT QUITE AS NICE
AS A RIVER BREEZE,

597
00:31:37,808 --> 00:31:39,854
BUT IT'S NOT BAD.MM.

598
00:31:39,854 --> 00:31:41,508
YOU FEELING THAT?MM.

599
00:31:41,508 --> 00:31:43,989
GOOD. [exhales deeply]

600
00:31:43,989 --> 00:31:46,861
RIVER BREEZE.

601
00:31:46,861 --> 00:31:50,169
WAIT A MINUTE. I LIVE
NOWHERE NEAR THE DOCKS.

602
00:31:50,169 --> 00:31:52,345
WELL, THAT'S GOOD.
IT'S A TERRIBLE NEIGHBORHOOD.

603
00:31:52,345 --> 00:31:54,347
YOU SAID YOU CALLED ME
BECAUSE I WAS CLOSER,

604
00:31:54,347 --> 00:31:56,958
BUT THE H.Q. IS
ONLY 15 MINUTES FROM THE DOCKS.

605
00:31:56,958 --> 00:32:00,266
I'M--I'M JUST--I'M BAD WITH
DISTANCES, ALWAYS HAVE BEEN.

606
00:32:00,266 --> 00:32:03,225
PATRICK JANE,
YOU WERE TRYING TO HELP ME.

607
00:32:05,445 --> 00:32:08,491
YOU WERE. YOU THOUGHT
IF I MADE A BIG BUST,

608
00:32:08,491 --> 00:32:10,667
THE P.S.U. WOULD GET OFF
MY BACK.

609
00:32:15,455 --> 00:32:17,892
YOU KNOW I'M ALWAYS
GONNA SAVE YOU, LISBON,

610
00:32:17,892 --> 00:32:19,981
WHETHER YOU LIKE IT OR NOT.

611
00:32:19,981 --> 00:32:22,027
I DON'T NEED TO BE SAVED.

612
00:32:22,027 --> 00:32:25,944
I KNEW THIS WOULD END A DISASTER
THE DAY I SIGNED ON WITH YOU.

613
00:32:25,944 --> 00:32:28,294
ONE DAY I'M GONNA GET FIRED
BECAUSE OF YOU.

614
00:32:28,294 --> 00:32:30,339
THAT'S JUST THE WAY IT IS.

615
00:32:30,339 --> 00:32:33,995
RIGHT. WELL, SOME PEOPLE MIGHT
ASK WHY YOU SIGNED ON WITH ME

616
00:32:33,995 --> 00:32:36,563
IN THE FIRST PLACE.WE CATCH A LOT OF BAD GUYS.

617
00:32:36,563 --> 00:32:39,087
MOST DAYS, THAT'S ENOUGH.
ALSO, I--[animal bleats]

618
00:32:39,087 --> 00:32:41,872
SHH. I THINK I HEAR SOMETHING.
SOMEONE OUT THERE.WHERE?

619
00:32:41,872 --> 00:32:43,309
HELLO!HELLO?

620
00:32:43,309 --> 00:32:44,919
OVER HERE!IN HERE!

621
00:32:44,919 --> 00:32:47,052
AROUND THE FRONT.
THE--THE BIG LATCH.

622
00:32:47,052 --> 00:32:50,446
I TOLD YOU
I WOULD SAVE YOU, LISBON.[chuckles]

623
00:32:50,446 --> 00:32:53,101
[Patrick] WHAT?

624
00:32:55,321 --> 00:32:59,194
[bleats]

625
00:32:59,194 --> 00:33:00,282
HEY.

626
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:16,907
SAC P.D. FOUND JANE'S CAR
AT THE DOCKS. LISBON'S, TOO.[whispers] CRAP.

627
00:33:16,907 --> 00:33:19,867
NO SIGN OF THEM
OR THE DRABERS.CALL SAC P.D., I.C.E.
AND THE COAST GUARD.

628
00:33:19,867 --> 00:33:22,304
HAVE THEM SEARCH
EVERY VEHICLE...[telephone rings]

629
00:33:22,304 --> 00:33:25,351
WAREHOUSE AND BOAT
THE DRABERS OWN.VAN PELT. O-OH. SLOW DOWN.

630
00:33:25,351 --> 00:33:27,875
AGENT RIGSBY.UM, Sí. UNO--UNO MOMENTO,
POR FAVOR.

631
00:33:27,875 --> 00:33:30,486
CAN YOU?I'LL CALL YOU BACK.

632
00:33:30,486 --> 00:33:32,967
[hangs up receiver]IT'S THE FEDERALES, I THINK.

633
00:33:32,967 --> 00:33:35,926
UH...SOMETHING ABOUT JANE
AND A GOAT?

634
00:33:38,581 --> 00:33:40,931
LOUISE WILLETT ROBBED

635
00:33:40,931 --> 00:33:43,934
THE VERY PEOPLE SHE WAS
SUPPOSED TO BE TAKING CARE OF,

636
00:33:43,934 --> 00:33:45,893
AND SHE SPENT THAT MONEY--IPSO FACTO, AD NAUSEAM.

637
00:33:45,893 --> 00:33:48,896
SORRY, ODENTHAL. I NEED TO
BORROW YOUR JUDGE FOR A SECOND.

638
00:33:48,896 --> 00:33:52,552
[clears throat] UH, MR. JANE,
